cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use REMORA in your research, please cite this repository."
title: "REMORA: Governed Execution Assurance for Tool-Using AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  REMORA decides whether an autonomous agent action is accepted, verified,
  abstained, or escalated, based on uncertainty, evidence, policy, auditability,
  and human review. This repository holds its research artifacts, benchmarks,
  claim register, and reproducibility tooling.
